  summary "Xuezhaihei Kria'Grace, an aurora observer at the Stack's twenty-third lens, witnesses the manifestation of Sholong's Codex in a torn aurora sky, which reveals seven catastrophic seals breaking across the Berg's penguin civilization. Through visions, she sees the systematic fraud of the Icebound Exchange, mining disasters in the Nightshelf, volcanic collapse, faction warfare, the failure of the aurora-light network, and ultimately the breakdown of the Flipper Accord between the two colonies. As the Stack burns with corrupted light and the Nightshelf freezes in darkness, a new reality emerges from the fusion of sky-light, volcanic fire, and primordial ice-memory, dissolving the boundary between the living and the dead. Kria'Grace returns to her alcove transformed, tasked with speaking what she witnessed despite knowing few will believe her."
